{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Presenting the Product", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Product", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Passive Voice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In English, the sentence structure usually follows the same sequence: <span class=\"italic\">subject + verb + object</span> . The subject comes first and the object comes last. However, if you don't want to pay special attention to the subject, you can change the word order. One way of doing this is by using the passive voice to change the focus in a sentence.  <br/> <br/>  The passive voice allows you talk about an event or action from the point of view of the thing or person affected. Sometimes you can write a sentence without even mentioning the agent (who or what was responsible for the action). ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This is how the passive is formed:  <br/> thing receiving action + be + past participle + (by) + (thing doing action)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Our press release was sent out by our staff last night. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Critical incident analysis was used to evaluate the risks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We were faced with many risks, but they were dealt with successfully. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Due diligence is required in times like this. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Future Simple and Simple Present ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When dealing with a crisis, it is important to give a supported argument about work-related processes. We use the Present Simple and Future Simple to describe problems and talk about how you will deal with a situation. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "a. Will<br/> If something is planned to happen or it is likely to happen in the future, you use the modal<span class=\"italic\"> will </span> (or <span class=\"italic\"> going to</span>) before the base form of the verb.<span class=\"italic\"> <ul><li>Kathy <span class=\"underline\">will</span>  help us deal with most of the legal stuff. </li> <li>Monitoring social media <span class=\"underline\">will</span>  keep us updated on any developments on the story. </li> <li>I <span class=\"underline\">will </span> definitely warn him about the crisis. </li> </span></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "b. Present Simple <br/> We use the Present Simple to talk about our thoughts and feelings in general. <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Let's catch up on the news. </li> <li>We need to decide on what to do next. </li> <li>I am proud of your good work.</li> <li>I'm concerned about the information on the last report. </li> <li>This exposure to risk is not good for us.</li> <li>The company's image is under a lot of pressure.</li> </ul></span> ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to keep abreast of ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stay informed about recently developments", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We will keep abreast of developments on the story.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you when planning a press release.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be on the radar", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be noticed or important", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Holly's has been put on the radar after this incident.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "compliance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of obeying a particular set of rules or laws", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Compliance is absolutely necessary at this time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to comply with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to obey a particular set of rules or laws", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Farmani did not comply with the regulations and got us all into deep water. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "in deep water", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in trouble or difficulty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If we don't comply, we will be in deep water.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "due diligence", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a reasonable amount of prudence, judgment, or effort", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Due diligence is required in those areas in order to be successful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "instability ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " an unsettling state due to the possibility of unpredictable events or changes ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a great deal of instability surrounding the company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "corporate governance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way a company is managed, especially by those at the top", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need good corporate governance and compliance in times of instability. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "public scrutiny", "type": "name"}, {"content": "careful examination of something by the public", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The company's image is under public scrutiny. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choose a corporate disaster or mistake that has appeared in the news recently (e.g. oil spill, automobile recall). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Research the disaster and what was done to make it right.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an imaginary press release (one paragraph) for the company.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include a description of what happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include a description of what will be done to fix the problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your press release to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research corporate disasters.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the passive voice to explain what was done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the future tense to explain how it will be fixed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my press release to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le14ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le14ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "20", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Alright, let's catch up on what's going on and decide on what steps to be taken next. We've got Kathy who will help us with some of the legal stuff. Miranda, could you start us off?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Our press release was read by our spokesperson. All potential problems have been diagnosed and critical incident analysis was used to determine the risks we were faced with.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I believe all those issues were dealt with successfully, right?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. A social media team was created to monitor, post, and react to social media activity throughout the crisis."}, {"image": "engenn8le14ob03re2img06.jpg", "time": "36000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Great. That way we will keep abreast of developments on the story. I am proud of the work we are doing. The processes and procedures that have been used confirm that this crisis is being well managed.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You're right. However, the same cannot be said about Farmani and Holly's. We need good corporate governance and compliance in times of instability.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Correct. Due diligence is required in those areas in order to be successful. Farmani did not comply with the regulations and got us all into deep water."}, {"image": "engenn8le14ob03re2img07.jpg", "time": "69000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Janet, I'm a little concerned about the last report that was sent to me.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Could you be more specific?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Holly's has been put on the radar after this incident. They have gained a lot of media exposure and this high exposure means a lot of potential damage to their brand.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I will warn Farmani. This exposure to risk is too great. The company's image is under public scrutiny. We need to do something about their brand."}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le14ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le14ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can exchange factual information and discuss future plans. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can give a supported argument about work-related processes that would benefit me and my employer.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What does \u201cbrand\u201d mean to you?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How important is a company's brand to you? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Before the press release", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nHolly's gets a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">push in the right direction</span>.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_a